  Description: Prerequisite Region - Golden Road You believe the city-states of Thuvia
    should be united into one nation under the rule of your home city (most commonly
    Aspenthar), and you're willing to do whatever it takes to make it happen. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Politics Lore
    skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Coercion] skill
    feat.
